/target
.idea/
.vscode/
# Scratch dir for spelunking through crate-cache sources while debugging
# upstream API surfaces. Never committed.
_inspect/
# Per-developer dev provisioning. Holds WiFi creds + backend URL for
# `paperanywhere-provtool` to bake into prov.bin. NEVER COMMIT.
provision.env
.env
# Built prov blob — derived from provision.env, regenerated freely.
prov.bin
# Standalone espflash binary the user dropped in (Windows .exe).
espflash.exe
espflash-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip

# Flash dumps + intermediate firmware bins produced during on-device
# debugging (espflash read-flash, app slot inspection, etc.). Multi-
# MB each, regenerated freely from the live device. The only `.bin`
# inputs the build legitimately needs (e.g. compiled boot-screen
# raster) live under `crates/*/target/` or are emitted from build.rs
# into OUT_DIR, neither of which sits at the repo root.
*.bin
# Scratch packet-capture scripts the user drops in at the repo root
# while diagnosing network issues. Not project code.
.tmp_*
